Opening Words:       422 (Surely the Lord is in this place...) 
Story for All Ages:  The trials of Hanuman (a Hindu story) 
Responsive Reading:  607 (Beloved Presence) 
Benediction:  (this is one not in the hymnal):       

May the Lord support you all the day long,
till the shadows lengthen and the evening comes, 
and the busy world is hushed, 
and the fever of life is over,
and our work is done. 
Then in His mercy, 
may he grant you a safe lodging and a holy rest and peace.

